{
  "name": "Daily EU TED, France BOAMP & UK Public Tenders Alert to Slack",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Daily EU TED, France BOAMP & UK Public Tenders Alert\n\n**How to set up (2 min):**\n1. Create an **HTTP Header Auth** credential: Header Name = `Authorization`, Value = `Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN>`.\n2. Customize `sources` (`EU_TED`, `FR_BOAMP`, `UK_FTS`), `keywords`, `countries`, or `cpvCodes` in the HTTP Request node.\n3. Connect Slack, verify `#public-tenders`, and activate the weekday 08:00 schedule.\n\nActor docs: https://apify.com/clearstack-data/eu-public-tenders-monitor",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "55555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555001",
      "name": "Setup Guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 8 * * 1-5"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "55555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555002",
      "name": "Every Weekday at 08:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/clearstack-data~eu-public-tenders-monitor/run-sync-get-dataset-items?maxTotalChargeUsd=0.25",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\"sources\":[\"EU_TED\",\"FR_BOAMP\",\"UK_FTS\"],\"keywords\":[\"software\",\"cloud\",\"cybersecurity\"],\"publishedSinceDays\":1,\"noticeCategory\":\"OPEN_TENDER\",\"onlyNewSinceLastRun\":true,\"monitorStateName\":\"eu-tenders-daily\",\"maxResultsPerSource\":25}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "55555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555003",
      "name": "Fetch New EU/FR/UK Public Tenders",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "const rows = $input.all().filter(i => i.json && (i.json.noticeId || i.json.title));\nif (!rows.length) return [];\nconst lines = rows.slice(0, 15).map(i => {\n  const t = i.json;\n  const val = t.estimatedValue ? ` | ${t.estimatedValue} ${t.currency || ''}` : '';\n  const ddl = t.deadlineDate ? ` | Deadline: ${t.deadlineDate}` : '';\n  return `- [${t.source} / ${t.country || '?'}] *${t.title}* (${t.buyerName || 'Public buyer'}${val}${ddl}) -> ${t.url}`;\n});\nreturn [{ json: { text: (`*Daily EU/FR/UK Public Tenders (${rows.length} matches)*\\n` + lines.join('\\n')).slice(0, 2800) } }];"
      },
      "id": "55555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555004",
      "name": "Format Slack Digest",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        740,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "#public-tenders",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": "={{ $json.text }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "55555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555005",
      "name": "Send to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        980,
        300
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every Weekday at 08:00": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Fetch New EU/FR/UK Public Tenders",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Fetch New EU/FR/UK Public Tenders": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Format Slack Digest",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Format Slack Digest": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send to Slack",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "pinData": {},
